      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-15T08:58:53.264+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Yeah, Sorry about that. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/c/unexpectedmaker had a video where he was losing his mind about parts flipping out during indexing. I had some similar things going on and probebly looked the same during that time. \nI have been doing some meta analyses on various things and this kinda popped out. \nWe're getting many extra wafers this round due to the error of only getting 6 prototyping wafers at first instead of the full 50",
